mption implementation can\n  start.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-4 (P1): higher-priority workloads preempt lower-priority ones per\n  admin-defined policy — this investigation determines which preemption\n  semantics the implementation must deliver.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37343,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc3876405083066e","agent_id":"a20f64792934626d2","session_id":"175a4578-f41d-49eb-8efd-6ff76cbc31ff","uuid":"ece5a2de-0678-4f0b-9b5e-beedf50fe640","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:37:13.462Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9005"}
