entation | Distributed Workloads | P0 | E001, outcome A |\n69\t| BRANCH-A-E008 | Enable PyTorchJob admission integration for gang scheduling | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 | E001, outcome A |\n70\t| BRANCH-B-E007 | Scheduler-plugin gang scheduling (coscheduling) for training workloads | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 | E001, outcome B |\n71\t| BRANCH-B-E008 | Adapt PyTorchJob scheduling for the scheduler-plugin path | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 | E001, outcome B |\n72\t| BRANCH-A-E009 | Policy-driven Kueue preemption with eviction and requeue | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P1 | E003, outcome A |\n73\t| BRANCH-B-E009 | Checkpoint-aware graceful preemption | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P1 | E003, outcome B |\n74\t| BRANCH-B-E010 | PyTorchJob checkpoint support for graceful preemption | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P1 | E003, outcome B |\n75\t\n76\t## Dependency DAG\n77\t\n78\t```mermaid\n79\tgraph TD\n80\t    E001[E001 Investigate gang admission] --> E005[E005 Dashboard visibility]\n81\t    E001 --> E006[E006 Topology-aware placement]\n82\t    E002[E002 Investigate topology maturity] --> E006\n83\t    E004[E004 Per-project GPU quota] --> E005\n84\t    E001 --> BA7[BRANCH-A-E007 Kueue-native gang admission]\n85\t    E001 --> BA8[BRANCH-A-E008 PyTorchJob integration]\n86\t    E001 --> BB7[BRANCH-B-E007 Coscheduling plugin]\n87\t    BB7 --> BB8[BRANCH-B-E008 PyTorchJob plugin adaptation]\n88\t    E003[E003 Investigate preemption semantics] --> BA9[BRANCH-A-E009 Preemption policy + requeue]\n89\t    E003 --> BB9[BRANCH-B-E009 Graceful preemption]\n90\t    E003 --> BB10[BRANCH-B-E010 PyTorchJob checkpoint support]\n91\t    BB10 --> BB9\n92\t```\n93\t\n94\tBranch epics are shown for completeness but are not main-plan nodes; the main\n95\tplan contains E001–E006 only.\n96\t\n97\t## DAG Justification\n98\t\n99\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n100\t|------|------|-----------|\n101\t| E001 → E005 | R