{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a805c68062f9fffb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9005-E002\n3\ttitle: Assess topology-aware scheduling Tech Preview maturity\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9005\n5\tcomponent: Distributed Workloads\n6\tteam: Distributed Workloads\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P2\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 1\n13\t  local_runnability: 0\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: -1\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Medium\n19\tai_implementability_score: 0\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Assess topology-aware scheduling Tech Preview maturity\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis investigation resolves the strategy's second open question: whether the\n30\tnode topology discovery that topology-aware placement depends on — currently\n31\tTech Preview in the platform — is mature enough to build the topology-aware\n32\tplacement requirement on in this release. The topology-aware placement\n33\timplementation is gated on this outcome and may be deferred entirely if the\n34\tanswer is negative.\n35\t\n36\t## Scope\n37\t\n38\t- Review the topology discovery / topology-aware scheduling capability's\n39\t  public documentation, release notes, API stability, and known issues.\n40\t- Identify what the Tech Preview scope excludes (supported node types, GPU\n41\t  topologies, NVLink domain reporting) and whether those exclusions affect\n42\t  the placement requirement.\n43\t- If feasible, verify reported topology information for GPU nodes on a test\n44\t  cluster and check alignment with what placement decisions would need.\n45\t- Produce a go/no-go recommendation for building topology-aware placement on\n46\t  this capability in the current release.\n47\t\n48\t## Acceptance Criteria\n49\t\n50\t- Given the Tech Preview capability's documentation and known issues, when\n51\t  evaluated against the needs of GPU-topology-aligned placement for training\n52\t  workloads, then a go/no-go recommendation is documented with the specific\n53\t  limitations that motivated it.\n54\t- Given a go decision, when the placement implementation starts, then the\n55\t  constraints the implementation must respect (supported topology levels,\n56\t  node types) are enumerated.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- HLR-5 (P2): job placement preferring GPU-topology-aligned nodes — this\n61\t  investigation determines whether that requirement can be delivered this\n62\t  release.\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e132ce62e656773","agent_id":"a68d4b19d59b431d6","session_id":"175a4578-f41d-49eb-8efd-6ff76cbc31ff","uuid":"32498f69-0b55-47ba-9a37-7194e3060282","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:56:02.940Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a805c68062f9fffb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9005"}
